<title>UK: Credit Local sets 500 mln Danish crown 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 500 mln Danish crown 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Bruxelles Lambert.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.375 PCT MATURITY    05 DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.85    PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.04 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
